    "teach_6": {
      "id": "teach_6",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Mixed modes are handled exactly the same way.\n\n120 km by bus at 60 → 2 hr\n150 km by train at 75 → 2 hr\n60 km by taxi at 30 → 2 hr\n\nTotal = 330 km in 6 hr, so average = 55 km/hr.",
