    "teach_8": {
      "id": "teach_8",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Stops count as time too if the question asks for the average over the whole trip.\n\nA car goes 80 km at 40 km/hr and returns 80 km at 80 km/hr.\nDriving time = 2 + 1 = 3 hr.\nAdd a 1-hour stop → total time = 4 hr.",
