      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Whole-trip average = total distance ÷ total elapsed time.\n\n160 ÷ 4 = 40 km/hr.\n\nThe stop does not add distance, but it does add time — so it pulls the average down.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
